The zupdf package bundles a copy of the pdfio library and its ttf library.
zupdf is distributed under the MIT license and pdfio under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, with exceptions. The two licences apply to their
respective files; the package as a whole is not MIT-licensed.


zupdf
=====

Copyright (c) 2026 Pedro Baltazar

Covers everything in the package except src/vendor/. Full text in
LICENSE.md in the source repository; CRAN's YEAR/COPYRIGHT HOLDER form is
in LICENSE.


pdfio and ttf
=============

Bundled in src/vendor/pdfio/.

Copyright 2021-2026 Michael R Sweet (pdfio); 2018-2025 Michael R Sweet (ttf).

Apache License, Version 2.0, with the exceptions in src/vendor/pdfio/NOTICE.
Full text in src/vendor/pdfio/LICENSE; the notice is reproduced in
inst/COPYRIGHTS. Upstream is https://github.com/michaelrsweet/pdfio, and
the pinned release, its commit, its checksum, the import date and the local
patches are recorded in src/vendor/PROVENANCE.


Adobe Glyph List
================

src/zpd_glyphs.h's glyph-name table follows the Adobe Glyph List, Copyright
2002-2019 Adobe, BSD 3-Clause licence; the notice is in inst/COPYRIGHTS.
